{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017Vn8sXTRN4DteHZvy6zprX","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_2/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-19\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp-003-p2v2: Helped samples have higher pure-model perplexity (model uncertain → attention helped) while hurt samples have lower perplexity (model confident → attention interfered), with architecture-specific patterns across GDN/RetNet/HGRN2. Retry with HGRN2 monkey-patch fix for _tied_weights_keys AttributeError.（准备中）\\\\n- exp-011: Cross-architecture variance on additional retrieval-dependent benchmarks (StoryCloze, BoolQ, COPA, PIQA, SciQ) decreases monotonically with attention ratio, providing a second statistically significant anchor (exact permutation p<0.05, two-tailed) beyond LAMBADA after Bonferroni correction（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp-008** (success): Replacing scipy.stats.spearmanr asymptotic p-values with exact permutation tests (n=5, 120 permutations, two-tailed) corrects the spurious p=1.4e-24 bug; expected: LAMBADA raw p≈0.017, Bonferroni adj-p≈0.100 (not significant), confirming need for additional benchmarks ← 基于 exp-001\\\\n- **exp-003-p2** (negative): Helped samples have higher pure-model perplexity (model was uncertain → attention helped), while hurt samples have lower pure-model perplexity (model was confident → attention interfered). This pattern is architecture-specific. ← 基于 exp-003\\\\n  [exp-003-p2 statistical summary](/api/workspace-files/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/artifacts/exp-003-p2/data/exp-003-p2_summary.txt)\\\\n- **exp-003** (negative): Architecture-specific helped/hurt samples on LAMBADA differ in surface features (token frequency, context length, lexical complexity), AND these feature profiles differ across GDN/HGRN2/RetNet — indicating architecture-specific mechanisms rather than generic attention benefit\\\\n  [sample_characterization_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/artifacts/exp-003/data/sample_characterization_results.csv) | [sample_characterization_figure](/api/workspace-files/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/artifacts/exp-003/chart/sample_characterization_figure_pointer.txt)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 5 / 负向 2 / 失败 0 / 共 8\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestb-48145: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- hgrn2_eval_1_3b_all: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2180, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018BuhDkjW4o3XdCDCJFtpvP","session_id":"b0a60b3f-284d-4bc2-abd7-c5a85964fe3f","uuid":"b25531f1-7d59-4a40-847b-644a947dc3fd","timestamp":"2026-05-19T14:18:13.780Z"}
