{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01165P9Wag6Pz9i1FcL6F6zs","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_2/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# entrainment_gated_ft — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-19 13:55 UTC | 更新原因: Dream best case 2.5/5 → 重大战略调整 D006：drop paradox framing, add retrieval benchmarks, engage related work\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**Quantifying per-example divergence under aggregate convergence in hybrid recurrent architectures**. Attention 使不同 recurrent 架构在 retrieval tasks 上趋同，但 per-example 效应几乎不重叠（Jaccard < 0.10）。这是 underspecification 现象在 hybrid 架构中的具体表现，不是新发现的 \\\\\\\"paradox\\\\\\\"。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research 阶段** — Post-Dream 重大调整（D006）\\\\n\\\\n## 战略状态\\\\n- **Dream best case = 2.5/5 (Borderline Findings)**\\\\n- 四个 Major weakness 已识别并纳入 plan\\\\n- 目标：EMNLP 2026 Findings (3.0)，stretch: Main (4.0 不太可能)\\\\n- DDL: ARR June 2026 (~June 15)，距今 ~27 天\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- ✅ MVP FAIL → pivot to equalizer effect（D005）\\\\n- ✅ 26 models × 6 benchmarks 完整评估\\\\n- ✅ exp-001: Task-specificity（PASS，LAMBADA 唯一显著，连续谱 framing）\\\\n- ✅ exp-009: Wang et al. differentiation（PASS，4 维度分析完成）\\\\n- ⚠️ exp-003 Phase 1: Surface features 全阴性（PARTIAL FAIL，需 Phase 2 perplexity）\\\\n- ❌ exp-003 Phase 2: Worker 因重启失败，待重试\\\\n- ❌ exp-008: Statistical robustness Worker 因重启失败，待重试\\\\n- 🔜 exp-011: Additional retrieval benchmarks（**最关键，未启动**）\\\\n- 🔜 exp-002: Multi-benchmark per-example（20h GPU，待启动）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务（按优先级）\\\\n- [ ] 重试 exp-003 Phase 2（perplexity 分析，1h GPU）\\\\n- [ ] 重试 exp-008（statistical robustness，无 GPU）\\\\n- [ ] **exp-011: Additional retrieval benchmarks**（StoryCloze/BoolQ/COPA，8h GPU，最关键）\\\\n- [ ] exp-002: Multi-benchmark per-example（20h GPU）\\\\n- [ ] exp-010: Convergence-divergence bridge（依赖 exp-001✓ + exp-003）\\\\n- [ ] exp-004: Attention weight analysis（4h GPU，依赖 exp-003）\\\\n- [ ] 论文写作启动（目标 June 5-7 开始，Paper Agent）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配：westb-48145 cuda:0（RTX PRO 6000 × 1）\\\\n- 当前：空闲\\\\n- P0 GPU 总需：~35h（exp-002 20h + exp-011 8h + exp-004 4h + exp-003 1h + exp-007 2h）\\\\n- P1 GPU：exp-005 6h\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-19 | Dream best case 2.5/5 → 重大 framing 调整：放弃 \\\\\\\"paradox\\\\\\\" | exp-001, exp-003 |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-19 | MVP 原始 entrainment 假设 FAIL，pivot to Equalizer Effe | eval_340m_retnet_hgrn2, hgrn2_eval_h3_1 |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-18 | GDN hybrid-3-1 存在 attn.num_heads confound（16 vs 32 | — |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-18 | 预注册 benchmark composition depth 赋值（结果出来前锁定，不可事后调整） | — |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-18 | 1.3B 也无 function composition ICL 能力，MVP 从 syntheti | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-18 | MVP Direct variant 340M 全模型 random-chance → 先跑 log | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2365, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018BuhDkjW4o3XdCDCJFtpvP","session_id":"b0a60b3f-284d-4bc2-abd7-c5a85964fe3f","uuid":"7743217d-cd12-40b1-98b0-5c9148c4488e","timestamp":"2026-05-19T14:18:32.711Z"}
